>>>> responded with "'Candy' or 'magic'." These are not names of the teas, but
>>>> just ways we refer to them. I think this would translate well as "le
>>>> titspi" and "le makfa", and that those would be more faithful than using
>>>> "la".
>>>>
>>>> Thoughts?
